    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94357" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῑτηρέσι-ον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>provision-money</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				6.2.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέκα τοῦ μηνὸς ὁ στρατιώτης δραχμὰς ς.
					λαμβάνει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					4.28
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδίδου τοῖς ναύταις ς</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				50.53
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐργώναις ς</span>”
