					<u>IG</u>
					42(1).103.168
				</span></i>
			 (Epid., <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>): generally, <i>allowance,
				pension,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PLond.
				3.955.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>; <i>annuity purchased,</i>
