				Milet.
				3.147.44
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; at Rome, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς.
			ἔμμηνον</span> a monthly <i>allowance of grain</i> to the
			poorer citizens, Lat. <i>frumentatio</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Crass.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
				26
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτοδοτέω</span>.</div>
